ockquote><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; margin: 0in; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: black;"><a href="https://portal.insperity.com/cs/nsp/SitePage/help_center" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://portal.insperity.com/cs/nsp/SitePage/help_center&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1657278984992000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1mKCYEI58VdWKZVeDAe3Ck" style="color: rgb(5, 99, 193);">Need Help</a></span><span style="color: black;">:&nbsp; Click on the hyperlink to navigate to our help page where you can access videos and quick tutorials designed to assist you with:</span></span></p></blockquote></blockquote><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><p style="text-align: left; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.75in; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: Symbol;">·</span><span style="color: black;">Manage your employee’s information such as: compensation, job titles, classification, and processing employee terminations. Just click on an individual employee’s name to start making changes.</span></span></p></blockquote></blockquote><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><p style="text-align: left; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); margin: 10px 0in 10px 0.75in; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: Symbol;">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-heigh